From: Veilark Build <build@veilark.local>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] android: preserve lifecycle fixes and add per-app routing

Preserve Veilark's Android 14+ SPECIAL_USE foreground-service contract and its
early-failure service cleanup from the verified baseline AAR. Keep application
routing at the Android VpnService.Builder boundary so it also applies to the
TrustTunnel transport. Never mix allowed and disallowed application rules,
ignore packages removed since preference capture, and fail closed when ONLY
mode has no installed selected application.
